Help Center

What is FX Replay?

FX Replay is a browser-based backtesting and trading practice platform. It lets traders replay real historical price data across Futures, Forex, Stocks, Indices, and Crypto, so you can test strategies, practice execution, and build consistency without risking real money. Unlike standalone trading journals or signal tools, FX Replay combines market replay, a built-in trading journal, AI coaching, a prop firm simulator, and custom indicators all in one platform. Over 1 million traders have used it to accelerate their development before going live.

