INTRODUCING OANDA: OUR NEW DATA PROVIDER
Introducing OANDA: Our New Data Provider

As we continue to innovate and improve the FX Replay platform, we're excited to announce a major upgrade that will transform the way traders engage with the forex market. Historically, we've relied on Dukascopy as our primary data provider, offering reliable historical data for traders to analyze and practice their strategies. However, we understand that traders need more options and flexibility to refine their skills and make informed decisions. That’s why we are thrilled to introduce OANDA as an additional data provider in the new version of FX Replay.

