HOW FAR BACK DOES THE DATA GO? CAN I TRADE THE 1M FAR BACK?
How far back does the data go? Can I trade the 1m far back?

You can trade on 1-minute charts, and for some assets, even on seconds charts depending on the available data. We have data up to the current week, and you can actively trade on 1-minute charts as far back as the asset’s data is available. The availability of historical data varies by asset. For detailed information on each asset’s data availability, please visit our website, scroll down to the features section, and you will find the specific assets listed. For some pairs, data is available as far back as 2016, while for others, it may extend further, such as to 2003.

