PROP FIRM SIMULATOR
Prop Firm Simulator

FX Replay’s Prop Firm Simulator lets you set your firm’s rules—drawdown limits, profit targets, and more—and start testing under real challenge conditions. No replaying back in time if you missed a trade — just real data, real pressure, and real preparation to help you sharpen your edge and build confidence before taking the actual challenge.

‍

How to use Prop Firm Simulator

Hit “Prop Firm Session” when creating a session.

‍

Add profit target, max daily loss, and max total loss rules that replicate your prop firm challenge.

‍

When you get into the chart, you’ll notice there is no replay functionality on the price skip control. This is
because we want to really provide that real life experience while practicing for a prop firm challenge.

‍

Hit tab button or click on “Prop Firm Rules” at the bottom to display the rules and where your current session is relative to those rules.

‍

If you fail your challenge, you can easily try again or go view your analytics.

‍

If you pass, congrats! You can view your certificate, share it with your friends to show that you’re making progress!

‍

