Data policy and Max Session duration:
‍
Session duration refers to the length at which you session can be. For example, a session on the beginner plan cannot be longer than a month (30 days). The constraints you would select are within that time window.

Data Retention refers to the data and the session itself. The session will remove itself due to the data retention policy.
