WHAT ARE THE TRADING SESSION HOURS THAT FX REPLAY TAKES INTO ACCOUNT FOR ANALYTICS?
What are the trading session hours that FX Replay takes into account for analytics?

While it's possible to trade the market at any hour, it doesn't mean it's always the best choice. The ideal time to trade is when the market is bustling with activity, with many forex traders buying and selling, resulting in a high volume of trades.

Session Hours These time periods may vary depending on factors such as daylight saving time adjustments and market holidays.When your trades are executed outside of these specified time sessions, they will be marked as "out of session" trades.

